      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 Collect jobs\nStarted by the scheduler (workflow 00) on the schedule you set (default every 6 hours): asks the service for the next slice of (title, location, source) searches, scrapes each one, then ingests the results.\n\n**Ingest = safety check + dedupe + free rule filters** (no AI is called here).\n\n- **Schedule and slice size are settings, not edits here:** `scripts/jobsearch schedule` (see docs/customization.md).\n- What to search for lives in your search settings (`scripts/jobsearch search-profile apply`).\n\n**Credentials needed:** none.",
